<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="450222919"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1778571262"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="戦国HOP"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YUC’e"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Athenarium"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:24.213"><div begin="00:00.000" end="03:24.213"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.770" itunes:key="L1">戦国HOP - YUC'e (ゆーしえ)</p><p begin="00:01.770" end="00:03.540" itunes:key="L2">词：YUC'e</p><p begin="00:03.540" end="00:05.310" itunes:key="L3">曲：YUC'e</p><p begin="00:05.310" end="00:07.080" itunes:key="L4">编曲：YUC'e</p><p begin="00:07.080" end="00:08.540" itunes:key="L5">「時は戦国<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时值战国</span></p><p begin="00:08.540" end="00:10.670" itunes:key="L6">びぃとに群がる猛者どもよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">严阵以待的猛将们啊</span></p><p begin="00:10.670" end="00:23.900" itunes:key="L7">今決戦の刻」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在到了决战的时刻</span></p><p begin="00:23.900" end="00:28.350" itunes:key="L8">甲胄かっちゅー兜の緒を締めろ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿好盔甲 系好头盔的绳子</span></p><p begin="00:28.350" end="00:32.780" itunes:key="L9">槍鉾てっぽういざ構え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">枪 矛 铁炮 摆好架势</span></p><p begin="00:32.780" end="00:37.110" itunes:key="L10">狙うは敵陣敵将の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">瞄准敌营 敌将的</span></p><p begin="00:37.110" end="00:41.930" itunes:key="L11">はぁとを頂戴致します<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">项上人头即可</span></p><p begin="00:41.930" end="00:48.200" itunes:key="L12">人は皆戦場を駆ける駆ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人们都驰骋战场</span></p><p begin="00:48.200" end="00:50.570" itunes:key="L13">跳ねる跳ねる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窜动着 窜动着</span></p><p begin="00:50.570" end="00:54.740" itunes:key="L14">今しがた無礼講<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今无须多礼</span></p><p begin="00:54.740" end="01:05.670" itunes:key="L15">御手を拝借<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首领向众人吆喝</span></p><p begin="01:05.670" end="01:42.550" itunes:key="L16">「皆の者かかれぇぇ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小的们 给我上</span></p><p begin="01:42.550" end="01:46.920" itunes:key="L17">八風はっぷん一層徳を積め<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">八风成全 更甚积聚德望</span></p><p begin="01:46.920" end="01:51.530" itunes:key="L18">御天道様の道標<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">得到太阳神的指路</span></p><p begin="01:51.530" end="01:55.630" itunes:key="L19">士気も威勢も上々に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">士气与气势也高涨</span></p><p begin="01:55.630" end="01:59.210" itunes:key="L20">雄叫び響かせ天高く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浑雄的吼叫声响彻天际</span></p><p begin="01:59.210" end="02:03.620" itunes:key="L21">あっそーれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊</span></p><p begin="02:03.620" end="02:12.370" itunes:key="L22">はーよいしょっ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哈</span></p><p begin="02:12.370" end="02:16.680" itunes:key="L23">はーよいしょっ</p><p begin="02:16.680" end="02:18.030" itunes:key="L24">あっそーれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算再幸苦也好</span></p><p begin="02:18.030" end="02:22.120" itunes:key="L25">辛くても辛くても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使再辛苦 再辛苦</span></p><p begin="02:22.120" end="02:26.650" itunes:key="L26">唄い踊り踊らにゃ損損<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱唱歌 跳跳舞 跳支阿波舞</span></p><p begin="02:26.650" end="02:30.780" itunes:key="L27">今しがた無礼講<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今无须多礼</span></p><p begin="02:30.780" end="02:41.550" itunes:key="L28">御手を拝借<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首领向众人吆喝</span></p><p begin="02:41.550" end="03:24.213" itunes:key="L29">「皆の者かかれぇぇ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小的们 给我上</span></p></div></body></tt>